  {
   "n": 6,
   "id": "3720bac9",
   "doc": "wp-post#155462",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Cape Cod Choice Awards 2026: Cape Cod Cannabis is a Top Finalist",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>The <strong>Cape Cod Choice Awards 2026</strong> celebrate the best local businesses across the Cape and we’ve made the <strong>TOP FINALISTS for BEST DISPENSARY ON CAPE COD</strong>!</p><p>Being <strong>the first dispensary in Wellfleet</strong>, Cape Cod Cannabis has become a trusted destination for high-quality cannabis, premium CBD products, and friendly, educational service. If you’ve shopped with us, learned from our team, or made us part of your Cape Cod routine, voting for us is a simple way to support local.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "A Local Wellfleet Dispensary Built for Cape Cod"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Cape Cod Cannabis is not a chain or corporate operation, we are <strong>locally focused and community-operated right here on the Outer Cape.</strong> From day one, our mission has been to create a cannabis dispensary that reflects the values of Cape Cod: <em>community, quality, authenticity, and care.</em></p><p>Located in <strong>Wellfleet, MA</strong>, our dispensary serves locals, visitors, and seasonal residents looking for safe, legal cannabis and trusted CBD products. Whether you’re new to cannabis or a longtime consumer, our goal is always the same, to provide a comfortable, informative, and welcoming experience.</p><p>That commitment to community is why so many customers consider us the <strong>best dispensary on Cape Cod</strong>.</p><hr>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Why Cape Cod Cannabis Is the Best Dispensary on Cape Cod"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Being voted Best Dispensary isn’t just about having products, it’s about the full customer experience. Here’s what sets Cape Cod Cannabis apart from other Cape Cod dispensaries:</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Premium, Curated Cannabis Products"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>We carefully select <strong>top Massachusetts cannabis brands</strong> known for quality, consistency, and transparency. Our menu includes:</p><ul><li>Fresh, lab-tested <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">cannabis flower</a></li><li><a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">Pre-rolls</a> for convenience and consistency</li><li><a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">Vape cartridges</a> and <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/disposables/\">disposable vapes</a></li><li><a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">Edibles and beverages</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>, <a href=\"/categories/topicals/\">topicals</a> and <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a></li></ul><p>Every product sold at Cape Cod Cannabis meets strict state testing and safety standards, so customers know exactly what they’re getting.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Knowledgeable & Approachable Budtenders"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Cannabis shopping can feel overwhelming, especially for first-time buyers. Our <strong>trained, friendly budtenders</strong> take the time to answer questions, explain effects, and help customers find products that fit their needs and comfort level.</p><p>No pressure. No judgment. Just honest guidance so you can make an informed decision of what’s best for you.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "A Trusted Wellfleet Cannabis Dispensary"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Our Wellfleet location, in the Rt. 6 Shopping Plaza in South Wellfleet, is designed to feel relaxed and approachable, making it easy to shop whether you’re stopping in after the beach or making a planned visit. We’re proud to be part of the <strong>Outer Cape cannabis community</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Responsible, Compliant & Community-Focused"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>We operate in full compliance with Massachusetts cannabis regulations and prioritize responsible sales, accurate labeling, and customer trust, every day.</p><hr>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Why Cape Cod Cannabis Is Also the Best CBD Store on Cape Cod"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>In addition to THC products, Cape Cod Cannabis is a go-to destination for <strong>high-quality CBD on Cape Cod</strong>, making us a strong contender for <a href=\"https://capecodtimes.gannettcontests.com/2026-Cape-Cods-Best-Communitys-Choice-Awards/gallery/?group=546675\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Best CBD Store</strong></a> in the Shopping Category.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Trusted, high quality CBD Products"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Our <a href=\"/categories/cbd/\">CBD selection</a> includes <strong>non-intoxicating products</strong> designed for everyday wellness, including:</p><ul><li>CBD tinctures and oils</li><li>CBD gummies and capsules</li><li>Topicals, balms, and creams</li><li>CBD products for pets</li></ul><p>All CBD products we carry are sourced from reputable brands that provide <strong>third-party lab testing</strong> and clear ingredient transparency.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "CBD Education You Can Trust"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>CBD can be confusing, and misinformation is everywhere. Our team focuses on <strong>education first</strong>, helping customers understand dosing, effects, and how CBD may fit into their wellness routine.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Wellness Without the High"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>For customers looking for relief, balance, or relaxation without psychoactive effects, our CBD store offerings provide approachable, plant-based options — making Cape Cod Cannabis a trusted wellness resource beyond traditional dispensaries.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
