  {
   "n": 8,
   "id": "323ccec",
   "doc": "wp-post#155462",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Thank You for Supporting Local Cannabis on Cape Cod"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>We’re incredibly grateful to our customers and community for the continued support. Whether you’re a year-round local, a seasonal visitor, or discovering cannabis for the first time, your trust means everything to us.</p><p>Thank you Cape Cod for recognizing Cape Cod Cannabis as one of the <strong>Best Dispensaries on Cape Cod…</strong>we will find out the results in September 2026 at the Cape Cod Choice Awards 2026 Gala event on September 10th.</p><p>Thank you for shopping local, supporting Wellfleet businesses, and helping us represent Cape Cod the right way.</p><p>– The Cape Cod Cannabis Team</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
